(text "VCC1-VCC9 and VCC_RTC share pre-PMIC VCC3V3_SYS; keep local bypass adjacent to pins. VCC_SPK_HP remains filtered 5V_SYS. All LDO outputs use 1uF." (at 55 156 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002a"))
(text "Y1 is Epson Q13FC13500004 (32.768kHz, CL=12.5pF, +/-20ppm). Keep XIN/XOUT away from SW1..SW5 and surround the crystal traces with GND." (at 55 170 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002b"))
